 "pitfalls": [
  "Disabled is a static variant (enabled: false): the click and ripple are left out at build time and the semantics say disabled, so it cannot be toggled at run time; for a button that becomes enabled, stack two buttons and switch with visibility",
  "The outlined ring is two stacked backgrounds (border cannot take a theme colour): on anything but the page background pass surface (\"@colors.surface\" inside a Card), or the inside of the ring shows the wrong colour",
  "An icon slot is drawn as given: paint it in the label colour yourself (onPrimary on a filled button)",
  "textFromFloat `whole` is the number of integer digits kept: whole 1 is enough for 1..9 only"
 ]
